{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4131470/extras/9a7d8912f678615cc27b4fab349f9f70.avif?t=1770962709\" width=1080 height=166 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>SoulUp</strong> is a <strong>hardcore action platformer</strong> that combines <strong>precise controls</strong>, <strong>parry-focused combat</strong>, and <strong>vertical platforming</strong>. In a towering structure where combat and movement flow as one, every decision and moment of timing determines survival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4131470/extras/4e1b404dfe61e397d572f687bb094d3d.poster.avif?t=1770962709\" width=750 height=314 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4131470/extras/4e1b404dfe61e397d572f687bb094d3d.webm?t=1770962709\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4131470/extras/4e1b404dfe61e397d572f687bb094d3d.mp4?t=1770962709\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Combat</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combat in SoulUp allows no room for mistakes. Attacks, dodges, and parries flow together in a single rhythm, and the ability to read enemy patterns and execute precise timing determines survival. This is not a game of simple attacks, but one of judgment and focus. Every battle tests the player's reflexes and composure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4131470/extras/fd0677d604099c8a2fc82c4ff436c2f3.poster.avif?t=1770962709\" width=780 height=326 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4131470/extras/fd0677d604099c8a2fc82c4ff436c2f3.webm?t=1770962709\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4131470/extras/fd0677d604099c8a2fc82c4ff436c2f3.mp4?t=1770962709\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Platforming Action</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The tower in SoulUp is more than just a path forward. Every platform and every jump is filled with danger, and falling is not failure, but part of the learning process. Through repetition, players learn the structure, refine precise control, and gradually climb higher.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hardcore combat centered around precise control and parry timing</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A vertical tower structure where combat and platforming flow seamlessly together</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A progression flow where player skill grows through falls and repeated challenges</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >UI support for 12 languages, including Korean, English, and Japanese</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Boss I \u2013 Fallen Guardian","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4131470/a07ba3a960c6438d2fcee7b712d3e7730f9c9a8f.jpg"},{"name":"Boss II \u2013 Trial of Steel","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4131470/683b4eab0d708a0dc63661c80f07ee4475b69570.jpg"},{"name":"Boss III \u2013 Edge of Despair","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4131470/04f833a4d01db4f649f700dbfa466f5399c53da3.jpg"},{"name":"Boss IV \u2013 Abyss Watcher","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4131470/a192d48231abad29946f1f8300cebe5b815c6deb.jpg"},{"name":"Boss V \u2013 Ascension","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4131470/cd595eb2d216d2c1f940f17f665287e148a4ad42.jpg"},{"name":"First Ascent","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4131470/7b230249fa0547b2134112358e6c5ef88646cda8.jpg"},{"name":"[Hardcore] Relentless Climber","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4131470/49fc97f259a61a5b8f394708918909784bb554fb.jpg"},{"name":"[Hardcore] Speed Is Skill","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4131470/69cabeebf3f4a299c4c7f808a78d0b306cfec928.jpg"},{"name":"[Hardcore] Vertical Blur","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4131470/28fbd8efa379e61b2604a59dcb918c45a7f87843.jpg"},{"name":"[Hardcore] No Time to Breathe","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4131470/19d2ee6ce13284beac4b5a4f24e6cdce02ed217e.jpg"}],"total":18},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4131470?t=1770962709","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4131470?t=1770962709","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4131470/5becb2c633f6c0c7bf89557b1aca76ac456496bc/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1770962709","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4131470/5becb2c633f6c0c7bf89557b1aca76ac456496bc/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1770962709","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4131470/extras/9a7d8912f678615cc27b4fab349f9f70.avif?t=1770962709\" width=1080 height=166 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>SoulUp</strong> is a <strong>hardcore action platformer</strong> that combines <strong>precise controls</strong>, <strong>parry-focused combat</strong>, and <strong>vertical platforming</strong>. In a towering structure where combat and movement flow as one, every decision and moment of timing determines survival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4131470/extras/4e1b404dfe61e397d572f687bb094d3d.poster.avif?t=1770962709\" width=750 height=314 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4131470/extras/4e1b404dfe61e397d572f687bb094d3d.webm?t=1770962709\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4131470/extras/4e1b404dfe61e397d572f687bb094d3d.mp4?t=1770962709\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Combat</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combat in SoulUp allows no room for mistakes. Attacks, dodges, and parries flow together in a single rhythm, and the ability to read enemy patterns and execute precise timing determines survival. This is not a game of simple attacks, but one of judgment and focus. Every battle tests the player's reflexes and composure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4131470/extras/fd0677d604099c8a2fc82c4ff436c2f3.poster.avif?t=1770962709\" width=780 height=326 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.stea